    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash, survive and get tougher - a wacky action roguelike with hand-drawn graphics and a caveman on the hunt for monsters! Just when you think you've seen it all, here it comes: a giraffe in a car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381780/extras/0e3f299bad21a2fcd7b1cf70b87afc1d.poster.avif?t=1741964358\" width=578 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381780/extras/0e3f299bad21a2fcd7b1cf70b87afc1d.webm?t=1741964358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381780/extras/0e3f299bad21a2fcd7b1cf70b87afc1d.mp4?t=1741964358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against 5 unique, <strong>hand-drawn opponents</strong> with different abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The waves are randomly generated and follow a <strong>sophisticated difficulty system</strong> that pits you against increasingly more and tougher opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your <strong>skills</strong> after each completed round and adapt them to your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful <strong>abilities</strong> to gain an advantage - whether you're escaping from tricky situations or planning the perfect attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too easy? In <strong>hard mode</strong>, you have to make strategic decisions: Do you heal yourself or improve your skills?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare your high scores with other players on our <strong>leaderboard</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Why does the caveman hit the giraffe in the car?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The caveman doesn't like technology :(</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash, survive and get tougher - a wacky action roguelike with hand-drawn graphics and a caveman on the hunt for monsters! Just when you think you've seen it all, here it comes: a giraffe in a car.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381780/extras/0e3f299bad21a2fcd7b1cf70b87afc1d.poster.avif?t=1741964358\" width=578 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381780/extras/0e3f299bad21a2fcd7b1cf70b87afc1d.webm?t=1741964358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3381780/extras/0e3f299bad21a2fcd7b1cf70b87afc1d.mp4?t=1741964358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against 5 unique, <strong>hand-drawn opponents</strong> with different abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The waves are randomly generated and follow a <strong>sophisticated difficulty system</strong> that pits you against increasingly more and tougher opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your <strong>skills</strong> after each completed round and adapt them to your play style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful <strong>abilities</strong> to gain an advantage - whether you're escaping from tricky situations or planning the perfect attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Too easy? In <strong>hard mode</strong>, you have to make strategic decisions: Do you heal yourself or improve your skills?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compare your high scores with other players on our <strong>leaderboard</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Why does the caveman hit the giraffe in the car?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The caveman doesn't like technology :(</p>",
